winevulkan: Wine-specific VR extensions for wineopenxr and vrclient.

VK_WINE_openxr_device_extensions and VK_WINE_openvr_device_extensions, with the
VkCreateInfoWineInstanceCallback and VkCreateInfoWineDeviceCallback structures,
let an OpenXR runtime create the Vulkan instance and device that a Direct3D game
renders with through DXVK. Proton's wineopenxr needs them to hand a D3D11 game's
swapchains to a native OpenXR runtime as Vulkan images.

From Proton (ValveSoftware/wine 1196bc013e1, Rémi Bernon, LGPL), which applies
cleanly to CrossOver 26.3. Proton generates winevulkan's thunks at build time;
the CrossOver tree keeps them in the source, so this patch also carries
include/wine/vulkan.h and dlls/winevulkan/vulkan_thunks.c regenerated by
make_vulkan (Vulkan 1.4.335, as pinned in make_vulkan). Not yet verified at
runtime on macOS.

diff --git a/dlls/win32u/vulkan.c b/dlls/win32u/vulkan.c
